}, {"path": "/@Aiaeaeaia/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1164943, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc8751d75e40eabe94ef3f8076d8a781", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc8751d75e40eabe94ef3f8076d8a781, https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14facfe53d1707bc8920c4c998b67653 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=015684cfcdc5fbbc2fdcc4ef8f74ad80 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=096a31251074de8fba358f8a1da50124", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=096a31251074de8fba358f8a1da50124, https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56c8b14f90ae127d2acd53b12cb5035d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aa2fc4e9/uploads/origins/6bbf09c5-0e51-4600-b685-c68da3caa7e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be4750c7aff32a730b57ff9f5000b707 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I'm resending the request, thank you for the extended text limit. I didn't realise that I had accidentally cut off most of the original text in my request, I apologise for the inconvenience.\n\nI've increased the payment since the previous submission, but please feel free to request a resubmission if you think it's not enough.\n\nThank you for the previous Touhou comics you've drawn. This time I'd like to request a transformation comic with two original characters. I've tried to be as detailed as possible with my instructions, but I'd like you to reinterpret it as much as you like.\n\nReference:\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/1umnst.png\nThis reference image includes a past scenario involving pregnancy elements, but I'm including it purely as a visual reference for the characters. The transformation is unrelated to this request. \n\nThe scenario for this story involves a exorcist duo, a teacher and their student. The teacher has a calm, proud personality, and is stern with her student. The teacher is used to being transformed as part of her job, and has returned to her normal human state many times before. Her student has a shy, clumsy personality, and panics easily in a high stress situation. \n\nBecause this comic focuses on the transformations, it's okay to depict the two's original pre-transformation appearance as a simple bust shot. I would like the transformation to be depicted in three stages, all additional drawings are up to you.\n\nIn this comic, the two have entered a corrupted zone in order to find and destroy a cursed artifact. The longer the two stay there and the closer they get to it, the more they're transformed. Eventually, the student becomes susceptible to mental corruption.  After the two find the object and destroy it, the teacher is able to quickly undo her own transformation, but the student lacks the necessary ability to do the same, and as punishment for slacking off on her training, she is to be left in her monstrous form for the time being.\n\nI'm happy to leave the details of the transformations up to you beyond what is specified, as I enjoy being surprised and always enjoy your designs. My one request is that the student maintains a cute appearance to their face even after being transformed.\n\nThe full outline, assuming one page per stage of transformation:\n\nThe two enter the zone, and immediately start to be corrupted and transformed. The teacher is able to minimise the initial changes to her body,  instead growing horns or antannae, extra eyes, and showing changes to their arms and legs, but retaining her basic humanoid shape of two arms and two legs. The student, who lacks the experience to halt the changes,  begins to change rapidly, gaining a more monstrous appearance as she begins to lose her normal humanoid shape. \n\nThe student panics, and her teacher says that she needs to get used to transforming this much if she's going to be an exorcist. The teacher says that she should have been given sufficient training to reduce her rate of transformation as long as she keeps a clear head. The student has already panicked, and says that it's impossible.\n\nOn the next page/stage of transformation:\n\nThe two have headed deeper into the zone. The teacher comments that the corruptive energies are getting stronger, and that even her own magical defences are starting to be worn down. The teacher has started to be more significantly transformed, and her arms and legs are starting to be reduced and cease to look like arms and legs. Due to the teacher's stronger magical abilities, her transformation is starting to treat her physical abilities as unimportant, and her transformation reflects this.\n\nThe student has become more monstrous, and appears to be the more physically powerful one of the two. She however still has her anxious personality and expression, and asks how much longer it's going to take, and that she doesn't even look human anymore.\n\nIn the third page, the two have reached the most extreme points of their transformations. Even the teacher has reached a completely inhuman form, save for her face resembling a human's.\n\nBy this point, the teacher has completely lost the use of her limbs, although she may have had them replaced with something else if you choose so. By this point, you could also have it be that she is either floating magically, or needs to be carried by her student. It is up to you.\n\nThe student, after her transformation has advanced so far, has started to become mentally affected and no longer worries about her transformation. \n\n(Please feel free to alter the dialogue and treat this as a guideline if you think something else would work better:)\n\nThe student says: \"I think I can see the goal, master! But I'm really starting to feel good, better than when I was just a human. Do we really need to destroy it? I think we're fine the way we are...\"\n\nThe teacher responds: \"Unbelievable! To think that a student of mine's mind has been corrupted. After we destroy the cursed object and get out of here, you'll be undergoing extra special training!\"\n\nSince the transformation has been fully depicted by this point, anything past this point is purely optional to draw. Thank you very much for reading this far.\n\nIf you're willing to draw one extra page (it can be lower detail than the others):\n\nWe see the two after they've destroyed the object and dispelled the cursed zone. The teacher has already been able to dispel 50% of her transformation, regaining her arms and undoing some of the other changes to her body and face. However, the student has regained her senses, but has been unable to restore her body to normal.\n\nThe student begs her teacher to help change her back to normal, but the teacher states that as punishment for her lack of training, she'll be remaining in her monstrous form for the time being, and this will teach her to not let her transformations get so advanced next time. The teacher privately thinks to herself that her student is actually very talented, but she'll never get anywhere as long as she keeps losing her composure.\n\nThank you once again! I hope I haven't asked for anything too unreasonable!", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Aiaeaeaia/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1164943, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd8d97660fc9fdfb28fb3b81ed4a01e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd8d97660fc9fdfb28fb3b81ed4a01e9, https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1daddd1ebfafbed097d0a660a75150b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b378b1f348d32189df923467410b2353 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c45168a2b0103539356ffb24199a1ecd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c45168a2b0103539356ffb24199a1ecd, https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d4247bbdcf0d96224aad67933b998fe1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b4b7268/uploads/origins/23f9d001-c46d-40c7-969f-4fb5e9a23d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7d2e1398099bcad56c279747f6b7aba 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、あなたのアートワークとモンスターのデザインが好きです。この漫画の依頼を検討してもらえると嬉しいです。\n背景：\n玄界灘では一夜にして皆の下半身が消えてしまった。まるで腰から切られて下半身が持っていかれたかのように。しかし、下半身がないだけで、上半身は普通に生きている。\nストーリー\n朝目覚めた霊夢は、スカートとストッキングを履こうとするが、下半身がないことに気づく。不器用な彼女はゆかりを訪ね、何があったのか尋ねる。\nゆかりは何が起こっているのかわからないが、「解決策を見つけた」と宣言する。ゆかりは境界線を操作することで、ランダムな4本足の動物の下半身と人の上半身をつなげる。その結果、皆の人生はめちゃくちゃになった。\n霊夢の下半身は熊、上半身は変化なし。4本の巨大な足のために、ストッキングとドレスを着ようとしている。ゆかりとこいしは、新しい下半身で霊夢の神社にお参りにやってくる。\n以下のストーリーを3〜4ページでデザインしてください。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Aiaeaeaia/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1164943, "client_id": 90941, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/uploads/origins/99f4602e-0845-4723-ac91-5b7af36ae083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ed6a04da7101a33fcc09452feab10e2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/uploads/origins/99f4602e-0845-4723-ac91-5b7af36ae083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ed6a04da7101a33fcc09452feab10e2, https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/uploads/origins/99f4602e-0845-4723-ac91-5b7af36ae083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97dca5e10bc6b2376b07fa166d7a82a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/uploads/origins/99f4602e-0845-4723-ac91-5b7af36ae083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3eb8535a31f3f3c4015bd7481aa6a8a2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/uploads/origins/99f4602e-0845-4723-ac91-5b7af36ae083?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7fba3537dcdf12d8615b4d29d5275789", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05d032d4/up